  "title": "Arkansas Tornado - National Guard Response (RAW)",
  "description": "The Arkansas National Guard responded to the tornados that struck central Arkansas on Sunday afternoon. Featured is the visit to the impacted sites by Arkansas Governor Mike Beebe, Arkansas Senator Mark Pryor and the Adjutant General of the Arkansas National Guard - Major General William Wofford. Soldiers from the 39th Infantry Brigade Combat Team and the 87th Troop Command of the Arkansas Army National Guard assisted law enforcement and emergency responders in Search and Rescue Operations, medical support and Traffic Control Points.",
